                    <L-2 L="EN">ECUC_Port_00131: Pre-processor switch to enable / disable the use of the function Port_SetPinDirection(). &lt;br/&gt;true: Enabled - Function Port_SetPinDirection() is available. &lt;br/&gt;false: Disabled - Function Port_SetPinDirection() is notavailable.</L-2>
